## Where tokens live

- `tailwind.config.ts` — `charcoal`, `terracotta`, `sand`, `olive`, `platinum`, `brandDark`, `brandLight`, `accent`, `creamCard`
- `app/globals.css` — CSS variables `--charcoal`, `--terracotta`, `--sand`, `--olive`, `--platinum`
- `app/opengraph-image.tsx` — hardcoded hex for OG art
- Visual side-by-side: `/brand-compare` (`app/brand-compare/page.tsx`) — left column is this checkpoint

## How to revert to this live version

```bash
git checkout palette-live-pre-guidelines -- \
  tailwind.config.ts \
  app/globals.css \
  app/opengraph-image.tsx \
  components/NavBar.tsx \
  components/BookButton.tsx \
  components/HowItWorksSection.tsx
```

Or reset the branch to the tag if a full rollback is needed (only with explicit user approval):

```bash
git switch -c restore-pre-guidelines-palette palette-live-pre-guidelines
```

Do not delete the `palette-live-pre-guidelines` tag or rewrite this checkpoint without asking the user.
